01:03:25,714 --> 01:03:31,714
The Cursed is a 2021 gothic horror film written,
directed and co-produced by Sean Ellis.

13
01:08:42,857 --> 01:08:48,857
The film stars Boyd Holbrook, Kelly Reilly, Alistair Petrie, and Roxane Duran.

14
01:14:00,000 --> 01:14:06,000
Its plot follows a 19th-century village in rural
France that is menaced by a werewolf.

15
01:19:17,142 --> 01:19:23,142
An international co-production of the United States and France, The Cursed premiered
at the 2021 Sundance Film Festival under the title Eight for Silver.

16
